UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Other than you, we sent two scouts through Algaz.  Only one returned.  Here''s what he discovered:$B$BThe Dragonmaws sent one of their Lieutenants, Maruk Wyrmscale, to organize a crew of orcs in Algaz and cut off the land route to Menethil Harbor!$B$BWe have to stop this, now.  Take out Maruk, and then report to Valstag Ironjaw in Menethil Harbor.$B$BMaruk is headquartered in a small cave, across a pond between the second and third tunnels of Algaz.  Menethil is through Algaz, then west along the road.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=462; -- <UNUSED>
