UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardXPId`=8, `RewardOrRequiredMoney`=6700, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=23400, `Flags`=16392, `RewardReputationMask`=1, `RewardChoiceItemId1`=56679, `RewardChoiceItemId2`=56680, `RewardChoiceItemId3`=56681, `RewardChoiceItemId4`=56682, `RewardChoiceItemCount3`=1, `RewardChoiceItemCount4`=1, `RewardFactionValueId1`=7, `Objectives`='Relwyn Shadestar at the Blackfathom Camp wants 8 Corrupt Brain stems.', `Details`='Foolish blood elves toil with demonic magic. Have they not witnessed what happened with the naga and with the satyrs of Kalimdor?$b$bI fear that the blood elves will meet a similar deformation. Azeroth cannot afford to give birth to another vile race of monsters.$b$bI wish to study the brain stems of the satyr and naga so that I might deduce what fate the Sin''dorei are headed toward. In Blackfathom Deeps, just to the west, you will find both satyr and naga.', `CompletedText`='', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=1275; -- Researching the Corruption
