UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=28800, `Flags`=16384, `Details`='At an impasse of sorts, you know that you will need the book translated into a language you can understand.  There certainly are a number of people in the world who could do it; the closest location that might have someone who could, however, is the Kargath outpost in the Badlands.  Perhaps that is a good place to start.
