UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=10200, `Flags`=16392, `Details`='Regret. It is all I have now. One bad decision resulting in several horrible outcomes. If only I had waited for those orders. Maybe they would have detailed the horrors that awaited us in those cursed lands! Maybe they were to redirect us to another detail? Ultimately, it was my fault. All of it was my fault.$B$BSo here I stand, awaiting orders. I must know. I must have those orders.$B$BDispatch Commander Ruag resides in Stonard. Find him and find out what became of the orders.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=2621; -- The Disgraced One
