', `Details`='Most of our recruits never make it to Booty Bay, $N. The shine of the insignia is enough to trigger the loot lust in even the staunchest of blacksmiths. Fools they be, as the insignia is a drop in the bucket compared to the wealth of items you''ll see!$B$BFind Galvan the Ancient and show him this pin. His residence is far to the north, between Zul Gurub and the Mosh''Ogg ogre mound.
