UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=85800, `Flags`=16384, `Details`='I watched as the human, Ras Frostwhisper, pledged his undying soul to the Lich King. He drew the dagger to his own throat and with a smile, cut from ear to ear. His body collapsed inside the borders of the pentagram. The Lich King stood over the fallen mage and with a single motion, Ras Frostwhisper the lich, was born.$B$B<Leonid gazes at the ground and then looks up at you.>$B$BYes, $r, I remember. What you seek has a name - Menethil''s Gift: The ground blessed by the Lich King - holy ground to Scourge.
