UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Word was sent here from Darnassus, $N. It seems one of your priestesses wants you to return home. Speak to Priestess Alathea at the Temple of the Moon whenever you''re able. It seems she is pleased with your progress. I am sure she takes great pride in seeing one of Elune''s servants take such great strides in $ghis:her; faith.$B$BThe Light be with you.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5665; -- <UNUSED>
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Oh, $N, I am pleased to catch you. There has been talk that you are prepared for your next test at the Temple of the Moon. Priestess Alathea herself wishes to speak to you. You should return to Darnassus as quickly as you can. Finish whatever business you have here and make haste.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5666; -- <UNUSED>
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Aye, good to see you''re doing well in your training, young $gpriest:priestess;. One of your kind was here looking for you not too long ago. It seems you''re wanted back in Darnassus. Something about Priestess Alathea and the Temple of the Moon. It sounded important. Perhaps you should return there soon.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5667; -- <UNUSED>
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5668; -- <NYI> A Blessing of Light
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Ah, $N, I''m glad you stopped to talk to me for a moment. One of your priests of Light was here a few moments ago looking for you. High Priestess Laurena in the Cathedral of Light wants to meet with you. I would not be surprised if it was about the progress you''ve made so far. Many of my order are continuously tested and given greater responsibilities as we progress in our studies.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5669; -- <NYI> A Blessing of Light
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='You just missed a messenger here from Stormwind that was looking for you, $N. You''ve done well for yourself it seems. The High Priestess Laurena wants to talk to you. I think the church feels you''re ready for the next step of your training.$B$BWhen you''re all set and done with your business here, head to Stormwind, the Cathedral of Light, and speak to her. I''m sure she''s waitin'' for you.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5670; -- <NYI> A Blessing of Light
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Young $gpriest:priestess;, your church has sent word for you to return to Stormwind. The High Priestess Laurena would have words with you when you are ready. It seems your superiors feel you are ready for the next step of your training.$B$BI believe you can find your High Priestess in the Cathedral of Light. Elune go with you on your journey and peace be with you.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5671; -- <NYI> A Blessing of Light
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardSpell`=0, `RewardSpellCast`=0, `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=5672; -- Elune's Grace
