UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=42900, `Flags`=16384, `Objectives`='Travel to the Wyrmbog in Dustwallow Marsh and seek out Emberstrife''s Den. Once inside, wear the Amulet of Draconic Subversion and speak with Emberstrife.
', `Details`='I have attuned this medallion with the magic necessary to create and maintain an illusion within the bounds of the den of Emberstrife.$B$BEmberstrife is an ancient drake; an old gatekeeper of Nefarian, burdened with the duty to test those dragonspawn that would ascend to the rank of elite guard to Onyxia.$B$BTravel to the Wyrmbog of Dustwallow Marsh and enter the lair of Emberstrife. Once there, put on the amulet and follow where your destiny may lead!
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=6570; -- Emberstrife
