UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=8400, `Objectives`='Travel to Gadgetzan in the Tanaris desert and speak with Dirge Quikcleave about advancing your cooking career.
', `Details`='I can tell by yer cooking spoon that ye know what yer doin''. Unfortunately, I can''t teach ya nothin''.$B$BLuckily fer ye, I know a guy. He''s a goblin and probably the best cook on Kalimdor.$B$BAyep, that''s the bad news, $g lad:missy; - ye got to travel to Kalimdor. Git to Gadgetzan and find Dirge Quikcleave. He''ll set ya straight.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=6612; -- I Know A Guy...
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Level`=25, `MinLevel`=23, `RewardOrRequiredMoney`=1800, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=15300, `Objectives`='Place Senani''s Banner on the Foulweald Totem Mound.  Do not let the furbolgs destroy the banner.  Defeat Chief Murgut and bring Murgut''s Totem to Senani at Silverwind Refuge.', `Details`='My research has paid off.$b$bI believe that with a show of force, we can diminish the furbolgs'' aggressiveness.$B$BTake this banner a short ways northeast and place it on their totem mound. They will try to destroy the banner, but hold your ground until their chief, Murgut, appears to save face for the tribe.  Bring me the totem he carries.$B$BGather your allies, $N. This is no task for a single $c.', `CompletedText`='', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=6621; -- King of the Foulweald
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=11700, `Details`='Good day, doctor. You will be tested on your ability to triage patients accordingly this afternoon. Should you pass your examination, you will join the prestigious ranks of Horde Trauma.$B$BNow pay attention! The critically injured must be tended to first. After the criticals come the badly injured. The injured should be tended to last. You must save 15 patients to pass this exam. You will fail should 6 of your patients die in triage.$B$BTriage bandages will be supplied.$B$BGood luck, doctor.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=6622; -- Triage
