UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=5700, `Flags`=16448, `Details`='If there is one thing that you should know about me, it is this: NEVER ask me about my business! I work with things you simply cannot understand. Like for example: Do you know what a psychotronic muzzledorf is? Of course you don''t! And that''s why we leave the planning to me and the fetching to you.$B$BAs I said earlier, if this is going to work, we''re going to need a 500 pound chicken.$B$BHead to Gadgetzan and speak with Dirge Quikcleave - he''ll get you started on finding a suitable specimen.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=8584; -- Never Ask Me About My Business
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=57300, `Flags`=16448, `RewardReputationMask`=1, `Details`='Legend has it that the chimaerok of the Isle of Dread in Feralas have the most succulent and tender vittles in existence! Now these chimaerok also have a daddy who, with proper preparation, may or may not look like a 500 pound chicken.$B$BHead to the Isle of Dread and kill Lord Lakmaeran and bring me his fresh carcass. That should satisfy the gnome. To satisfy me, you''ll need to get your hands on some chimaerok tenderloin.$B$BDo this and you''ll have your 500 pound chicken and a little something extra.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=8585; -- The Isle of Dread!
