UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Level`=7, `MinLevel`=5, `ZoneOrSort`=3524, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=180, `Objectives`='Take Chellan''s List to the hippogryph master Zaldaan at Azure Watch.', `Details`='Welcome to Azure Watch, $c. Please excuse the disorder you see around you. It''s easy to take simple things for granted, like a fully furnished and stocked inn, until you''re forced to build one from nothing.$B$BWe''ve managed to salvage this pod for a building, but without the proper furnishings and first aid supplies, the inn is little more than a glorified tent. Nurguni at the Exodar has offered to put together a package to help with our most immediate needs, but I need someone to deliver this list to him.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=9603; -- Beds, Bandages, and Beyond
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Level`=7, `MinLevel`=5, `ZoneOrSort`=3524, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=180, `Objectives`='Purchase a hippogryph ride to the Exodar from Zaldaan. When you land, take Chellan''s List to Nurguni in the Seat of the Naaru at the Exodar.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=9604; -- On the Wings of a Hippogryph
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Level`=7, `MinLevel`=5, `ZoneOrSort`=3524, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=180, `Objectives`='Find Stephanos at the Seat of the Naaru inside the Exodar and purchase a hippogryph ride back to Azure Watch.', `Details`='Here''s the box, $N. That should be enough for Chellan to get the inn up and running. Let her know that she can keep sending in orders as the need arises. Azure Watch urgently needs a place to care for the wounded and put up any travelers they receive.$B$BWhen you''re ready to return to Azure Watch, seek out Stephanos near the Seat of the Naaru in the Exodar.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=9605; -- Hippogryph Master Stephanos
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Level`=7, `MinLevel`=5, `ZoneOrSort`=3524, `RewardOrRequiredMoney`=350, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=390, `Title`='Return to Caregiver Chellan', `Objectives`='Speak with Stephanos to purchase a hippogryph ride back to Azure Watch. Once you have arrived, deliver Nurguni''s Supplies to Caregiver Chellan.', `Details`='If I remember correctly, Azure Watch''s hippogryph master is Zaldaan.  If you''ve spoken to him before, then you can take one of my hippogryphs to him.$B$BThat''s a good lesson to know: hippogryphs are always trained to fly to their capital city, but they''ll only take you to a remote hippogryph master after you''ve already been there.$B$BSince you arrived on one of Zaldaan''s hippogryphs, you can also use that route to return to Azure Watch with the caregiver''s supplies.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=9606; -- Return to Topher Loaal
