UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=18900, `Details`='It shames me to ask for your assistance once more, $N, but you are my flight''s only hope. Without my mate, the netherwing brood may die out completely.$B$BMake your way to the top of Dragonmaw Fortress and find Karynaku.$B$BWe will be flying overhead. Should a break appear in their defenses, the might of the netherwing will swoop down to assist you.
