UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='The Razaani ethereals have strange devices that emit small, pink floating light orbs.  They remind me of souls.$B$BThey are not to be confused with the large yellow balls that break free of the ethereal when they die, these are something else entirely.$B$BI''d like for you to head north to Razaan''s Landing and drop some totems, which will attract the pink light orbs.$B$BBring them back to me so that I might determine exactly what they are.', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=10859; -- Gather the Orbs
