UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Type`=0, `SuggestedPlayers`=0, `Objectives`='Dwarfowitz at the Sha''tari Base Camp in the Bone Wastes wants you to recover Enormous Bone Worm Organs.$B$BHe wants his Fumper back too.
', `Details`='I was right! These carcasses you brought me belong to maturing worms. Do you know what that means? It means that somewhere out there is a big one! I think we can get it to come out if we can provide the right kind of food. Let''s see... something big! Yes!$B$BI remember seeing clefthooves east of here on the other side of the Bone Wastes. Get out there and kill a clefthoof. Once it''s dead, use the drums. Hopefully the big one will come up to feed. If you manage to kill it, bring me its organs!', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=10930; -- The Big Bone Worm
