UPDATE `quest_template` SET `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11063; -- Earning Your Wings...
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=75900, `Details`='Don''t let the gray hair fool you, grunt. I''m still ten times the rider that you are! And don''t go thinking that this old dog doesn''t have any tricks up his sleeve.$B$BNow all you gotta do is follow me and try not to get knocked down off your mount. If you can do that, Oldie will admit defeat.$B$BWe''ll lift off as soon as you''re ready.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11064; -- Dragonmaw Race: The Ballad of Oldie McOld
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=75900, `Details`='Wanna help the Skyguard and Ogri''la?$B$BJust hear me out before you walk away, $g hot stuff : girly;.  We''re in need of remounts!  The bombing runs and missions to Bash''ir Landing have taken a toll on our mounts.$B$BThe aether rays that fly around Vortex Summit, and the Crystal Spine to the northeast, look like they''d do just fine.  You don''t even have to bring them back here, though that would be nice.  Just break and rope them, and we''ll track them down later.$B$BThink you can wrangle me up some?', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11065; -- Wrangle Some Aether Rays!
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=75900, `Details`='So, I hope that you''re up to helping us wrangle up even more aether rays!  From what I can see, you''re a natural with the rope!  And it''s for a good cause, because not only do we get fresh mounts, but it helps us to protect Ogri''la, which the ogres appreciate.$B$BRemember, the aether rays fly around Vortex Summit, and the Crystal Spine to the northeast.$B$BThink you can wrangle me up some more?', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11066; -- Wrangle More Aether Rays!
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=75900, `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11067; -- Dragonmaw Race: Trope the Filth-Belcher
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=94800, `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11068; -- Dragonmaw Race: Corlok the Vet
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=94800, `Details`='Three years I spent in that hell hole. Three years a prisoner of war to the damnable Frostwolf Clan. Made to sit in their tower and listen to them endlessly whine about the bridge to Dun Baldar. About how it''s \"unfair\" that blah, blah, blah, blah... War isn''t fair! To hell with ''em all!$B$BThe minute I was freed I left that place forever and came here to start a new life. Now Mulv and I are vying for the top orc spot. If you want it, you''re gonna have to go through me, scrub.$B$BWe go when you''re ready.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11069; -- Dragonmaw Race: Wing Commander Ichman
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=94800, `Objectives`='Follow Wing Commander Mulverick while attempting to stay on your flying mount. Should you defeat Wing Commander Mulverick, report your victory to Ja''y Nosliw at the Dragonmaw Base Camp in Shadowmoon Valley.
', `Details`='Three years of blood, sweat and tears. Mostly tears... The amount of crying that a hardened soldier does when it comes down to all-out war is amazing!$B$B\"They''re jumping into our tower with their horses!\" \"Why is their base so well defended?\" \"They''re taking our relief hut, I''m going A.W.O.L.!\"$B$BWimps...$B$BI took the first train out of \"cry-town\" the minute the Dark Portal opened. Now I''m a top gun for the Dragonmaw. If you want to be top orc, you''ll have to defeat me.$B$BWe go when you are ready.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11070; -- Dragonmaw Race: Wing Commander Mulverick
