UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=121800, `Objectives`='Zaza at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to use the Pile of Fake Furs to trap 8 Nesingwary Trappers.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11865; -- Unfit for Death
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=121800, `Details`='Whether they be treasure seekers or bloodthirsty hunters of the wastes, any being that supports Nesingwary and dares to strike at our beloved wildlife shall be considered an enemy of D.E.H.T.A.$B$BShould you slay these filthy Nesingwary sympathizers, bring me proof of their demise and you shall be rewarded with a blessing from the druids of D.E.H.T.A.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11866; -- Ears of Our Enemies
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Details`='Whether they be treasure seekers or bloodthirsty hunters of the wastes, any being that supports Nessingwary and does dare strike at our beloved wildlife shall be considered an enemy of D.E.H.T.A. Should you slay these filthy Nesingwary sympathizers, bring me proof of their demise and you shall be rewarded with a blessing from the druids of D.E.H.T.A.
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11867; -- Can't Get Ear-nough...
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Type`=0, `SuggestedPlayers`=0, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=121800, `Details`='Near the southern end of this bluff is where you will find the treacherous leader of the caribou trappers. She is a savage like no other, making a mockery out of the carcasses of the slain animals: drinking from their blood and howling to the moons!$B$BFind this murderer, Karen, and end her worthless existence.$B$BPrepare yourself properly, $N. Karen the Culler has indulged in the riches that Nesingwary has lavished upon her!', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11868; -- The Culler Cometh
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=121800, `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11869; -- Happy as a Clam
UPDATE `quest_template` SET `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=12300, `Details`='We have just gotten word from Liandra that mercenaries hired by Nesingwary are moving goods off the beach and onto the main Nesingwary shipping vessel. No doubt they plan on making a fortune from their murderous trade!$B$BShe has asked that we send assistance to the Abandoned Reach, directly south of here on the beachfront of the Borean Tundra.$B$BMake haste, Liandra awaits you there!
', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=11870; -- The Abandoned Reach
