UPDATE `quest_template` SET `Type`=0, `SuggestedPlayers`=0, `RewardMoneyMaxLevel`=182700, `Objectives`='Arch Druid Lathorius at the D.E.H.T.A. Encampment in the Borean Tundra wants you to kill Harold Lane.', `Details`='You have done much for the animals of the Borean Tundra, $N. Nesingwary''s lackeys have been beaten back and taught a lesson that they will not soon forget.$B$BHarold Lane, the primary agent responsible for the mass slaughters in Nagrand, has been identified as the man in charge of Nesingwary operations in the tundra. He is stationed at Lake Kum''uya, west of here.$B$B<Lathorius hands you an intricately carved oak horn.>$B$BFind Lane and kill him. Use this horn should you require our aid.
