I''ll disguise you as a package runner. I saw a stockpile guarded by their goons outside the gates. Go run by, and DON''T stop, or they''ll make you! They''ll toss you a crate. Bring it back here.', `EndText`='Steal perfume package from Crown Chemical Co. outside Stormwind', `WDBVerified`=15595 WHERE `Id`=24656; -- Pilfering Perfume
